  "label": "Body Transformation Within Hours Stereotype",
  "description": "A misleading and unrealistic stereotype that implies dramatic physical changes (like extreme muscle gain or fat loss) can occur within a very short time frame (e.g., hours). This is a common trope in fitness memes and clickbait, often used to exaggerate or sensationalize results, and is not grounded in realistic physiology or training science.",
